---@field DefaultCooldown? aws.auto_scaling.Cooldown Only needed if you use simple scaling policies.
---@field AvailabilityZones? aws.auto_scaling.AvailabilityZones A list of Availability Zones where instances in the Auto Scaling group can be created. Used for launching into the default VPC subnet in each Availability Zone when not using the VPCZoneIdentifier property, or for attaching a network interface when an existing network interface ID is specified in a launch template.
---@field AvailabilityZoneIds? aws.auto_scaling.AvailabilityZoneIds A list of Availability Zone IDs where the Auto Scaling group can launch instances. You cannot specify both AvailabilityZones and AvailabilityZoneIds in the same request.
